&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven SaaS Sales Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong track record of success in enterprise SaaS sales, with a focus on securing new business and consistently achieving revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
