&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evangelize the Platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a champion for the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform, showcasing its transformative capabilities and articulating its value proposition to both new and existing customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategically Prospect:&lt;/strong&gt; Use modern tools and creative strategies to connect with prospective clients via cold calls, email, and social channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive sales growth by setting up qualified meetings and creating a robust pipeline for our Account Executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Your Territory:&lt;/strong&gt; Be responsible for a defined territory, developing new accounts and expanding our relationships with existing customers to maximize market potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Sales &amp;amp; Marketing:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with sales to define and execute account-based strategies, and partner with marketing to promote campaigns and events while following up on new leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Complex Sales Cycles:&lt;/strong&gt; Effectively multithread different lines of business within complex enterprise accounts to build broad support and consensus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
