&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a BA/BS from a top university or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-3 Years of sales experience or business development experience in a SaaS organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to engage senior stakeholders and tell a compelling story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You adapt quickly and thrive in a dynamic, fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A results-driven attitude with a strong desire to compete &amp;amp; exceed targets&lt;/li&gt;
