&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Sales – Public Sector Iberia team operates at the forefront of governmental transformation. Working in close coordination with Sales Leadership and Value Engineering,&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt; our mission is to act as the operational and governance backbone for public administrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt; We are dedicated to transforming complex,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot;&gt; siloed processes into transparent,&lt;/span&gt; agile, and citizen-centric public services, leveraging Celonis&#39; position as the pioneer and global market leader in Process Intelligence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;As an Account Executive for Public Sector (Iberia) based in Madrid, you will build upon the high-impact foundation established across regional governments (Comunidades Autónomas), public healthcare systems (Servicios de Salud), central agencies (AGE), and state-owned entities. Drawing directly from our field engagements, AI governance, and modernization projects, you will drive end-to-end sales cycles—from achieving high-level political alignment to securing technical tender awards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive New Business &amp;amp; Account Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Own quota and execution across assigned public sector accounts by engaging directly with executive decision-makers (Consejeros, Directores Generales, etc.) to position Celonis as an institutional platform for digital sovereignty.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Navigate Public Procurement:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the qualification and pursuit of public contracts under the Spanish Public Procurement Law (LCSP), ensuring tender specifications perfectly reflect our Process Intelligence value, while coordinating with internal Legal and Compliance teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the Partner Ecosystem:&lt;/strong&gt; Work in active co-selling motions with Tier-1 and regional public sector partners (e.g., Inetum, Telefónica, Minsait, NTT Data) to defend technical proposals and deliver integrated consortium bids.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Execute Value Selling:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Value Engineers to scope and execute high-converting Proofs of Value (PoVs) tailored to Healthcare (e.g., surgical scheduling), Citizen Services (e.g., social aid pipelines), and Back-Office functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead Executive Briefings &amp;amp; Demand Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead high-impact C-level briefings at the Madrid Innovation Hub, collaborate on Account-Based Marketing (ABM) campaigns across public sector forums, and elevate flagship accounts into European benchmark references.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;7+ years of quota-carrying enterprise SaaS or complex software sales experience, with at least 3–5 years selling directly into Spanish Public Administrations (AGE, Comunidades Autónomas, Servicios Regionales de Salud).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;Proven mastery of Spanish public procurement procedures, including LCSP, Pliegos de Prescripciones Técnicas y Cláusulas Administrativas, Acuerdos Marco, Compra Pública Innovadora, and Fondos MRR / NextGen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;Established relationships with major public sector IT providers and consulting partners in Spain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;Strong solution acumen with the ability to bridge high-level policy goals (budget transparency, citizen wait-time reduction) with data-driven technologies (Process Mining, Task Mining, Automation/Enterprise AI).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;Experience coordinating cross-functional pursuits involving internal technical, legal, and global executive leadership teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot;&gt;Native/bilingual fluency in Spanish and full professional working proficiency in English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
