&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis Services is a strategic organization focused on optimizing our customers&#39; business processes through technical expertise. We integrate Consulting Services, Academy, and Customer Support to deliver comprehensive solutions. As thought leaders with deep product, technical, and domain expertise, we specialize in implementing Celonis to drive the adoption of process intelligence, ultimately transforming and improving our customers&#39; core business operations. We achieve this by leveraging our best practices, extensive delivery experience, award-winning enablement programs, and robust support infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead AI Deployment Architect, you will work directly with customers to understand their problems and design, deploy and scale innovative AI solutions and automations using our Process Intelligence platform. In a pre-sales and post sales capacity you will work closely with other AI experts across Product &amp;amp; Engineering and GTM to standardize these solutions and bring them to our customer base at scale. We are ideally looking for individuals with in-depth practical experience in delivering solutions to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architect &amp;amp; Deploy:&lt;/strong&gt; Prototype, develop, and scale end-to-end AI solutions tailored to customer needs, leveraging &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;113&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;121&quot;&gt;LLM-based architectures (RAG)&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;156&quot;&gt;Machine Learning&lt;/strong&gt; models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Pitch the Celonis AI value proposition to C-level stakeholders, aligning our &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;98&quot;&gt;Process Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt; capabilities with their broader enterprise AI strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Scale Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify high-impact AI use cases across the Celonis platform and package them into scalable, repeatable offerings (e.g., via the &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;148&quot;&gt;Machine Learning Workbench&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead &quot;Lighthouse&quot; Projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and execute the technical roadmap for AI Lighthouse customers, ensuring successful value realization from pilot to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Feedback:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the technical voice of the customer, collaborating with Product &amp;amp; Engineering to influence the roadmap for &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;141&quot;&gt;AI Agents&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;155&quot;&gt;automation capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enablement &amp;amp; Evangelism:&lt;/strong&gt; Train internal teams on AI deployment best practices and share success stories to elevate the organization’s technical maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Full-Stack Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and architect deployments that seamlessly integrate &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;86&quot;&gt;AI, Process Intelligence, and Automation&lt;/strong&gt; into complex enterprise IT landscapes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The preferred qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in an analytical role with the objective to demonstrate or secure value through business data analysis, business process improvement and/or respective Software deployment. Ideally in a customer-facing role with a Consultancy or Business Software / SaaS Provider. Alternatively in an Inhouse role (e.g. Center of Excellence for Data Mining / Analytics / Intelligence) within an Enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience developing AI solutions for enterprises, with a strong portfolio showcasing successful use cases solving real-world problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in programming languages such as Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills, analytical thinking, and attention to detail, with a track record of delivering high-quality solutions under tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to translate complex concepts into actionable insights for non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in production level acceptance testing, delivering end-to-end solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visionary architectural mindset to develop scalable &amp;amp; easily extensible solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical acumen to be able to choose the right AI solution / technology for the respective customer pain point&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or higher in Computer Science, Engineering, Mathematics, Econometrics or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
