&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with Partners, i.e., Consulting firms and Enterprise Tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and Italian&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to a fast-moving, ever-changing, high-growth environment and approach challenges with positivity, creative thinking, and a growth mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to be collaborative, inclusive, embrace diversity, and possess strong interpersonal skills #differentmakesusbetter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy working autonomously, managing your own time and priorities to achieve objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel 50% of the time within Italy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic and hands-on, owner mentality, agility and execution first.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
