&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years of leadership experience managing multiple vertical, with a track record of recruiting, motivating, developing, and retaining top talent in high performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
