&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Information-oriented Business Administration/Economics, Business Informatics, Business Education, Mathematics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English; additional languages are beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven experience in creating and delivering training to diverse audiences.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for learning, knowledge transfer, Big Data, and Data Analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with a structured approach to problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly learn new topics and concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to think creatively and continuously expand your knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating complex data and working with intricate processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel (up to 40%).&lt;/li&gt;
