&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of the Finance/Supply Chain domains and cross industry trends. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
