&lt;p&gt;Celonis is looking for a Senior ABAP Developer to design and implement modern data integration features to our platform.&amp;nbsp;This is a full-time position located in Bengaluru, India and we are looking for team members that focus on writing maintainable and reliable code, work well independently, and thrive on collaboration and feedback as part of an agile development process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of features from design to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend the capabilities of SAP integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute towards continual improvements in our development and release processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with our cloud development teams in integrating new features we develop in SAP with our cloud product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and drive new integration possibilities with SAP’s cloud products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
