&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have at least 5 years of experience as a professional ABAP Developer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of commitment and responsibility as well as enthusiasm for the challenges that arise during software development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with object-oriented ABAP and GUI development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with both R3 and S4/HANA, with knowledge of the FI, MM, and SD modules as a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have an overall understanding of SAP products, with a deep focus on integration options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear, maintainable, and testable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
